  "title": "第 11 章選修：盒側保護蓋的徑向與軸向端隙草案",
  "sourceSummary": "learning/evidence/08/2026-10-28-side-thread-cap-gui-v001/demo-files/u11_side_thread_cap_draft_v001.blend",
